From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seilent <github@seilent.net>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 08:34:58 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: codecs: aw88261: Keep the volume across profile changes

A profile change set the volume control to 0 dB attenuation, the
loudest setting. Keep the volume the user set.

Signed-off-by: seilent <github@seilent.net>
---
 sound/soc/codecs/aw88261.c | 3 ---
 1 file changed, 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/sound/soc/codecs/aw88261.c b/sound/soc/codecs/aw88261.c
index 7a16bb413..c662280d9 100644
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/aw88261.c
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/aw88261.c
@@ -422,9 +422,6 @@ static int aw88261_dev_reg_update(struct aw88261 *aw88261,
 	if (ret)
 		return ret;
 
-	if (aw_dev->prof_cur != aw_dev->prof_index)
-		vol_desc->ctl_volume = 0;
-
 	/* keep min volume */
 	aw88261_dev_set_volume(aw_dev, vol_desc->mute_volume);
 
-- 
2.55.0

